fullDescription:
This Christmas gnome collection includes high quality hand drawn watercolor christmas cliparts. All elements are high resolution (300dpi) PNG files with transparent backgrounds. Perfect graphic for your projects, christmas party invitations, poster,greeting cards,textile and much more.

This Collection includes:

74 files:

8 seamless patterns in PNG and Jpeg ( 300dpi 5000x5000px);

6 gnomes in PNG (transparent background 300dpi ~2200x4500px)

44 elements in PNG 300dpi ~700x4500px;

3 christmas wreaths in PNG and Jpeg ( 300dpi 5000x5000px);

2 christmas frames in PNG and Jpeg ( 300dpi 5000x5000px);

11 pre-made illustrations in PNG.
